THOUGHT: Now let's apply our fix more carefully, targeting only the Python 3.11+ section:

```bash
sed -i '/if sys.version_info >= (3, 11):/,/else:/ {
    /@property/,/def deadline/ {
        /return self.when()/c\        @property\
        def deadline(self) -> Optional[float]:\
            when = self.when()\
            return when if when != -1.0 else None
    }
}' async_timeout/__init__.py
```

